---
source: crates/sirene-core/tests/sequence.rs
expression: "sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant Server\n    participant Cache\n    loop Every minute\n        Client->>Server: poll\n    end\n    alt hit\n        Server->>Cache: get\n        Cache-->>Server: value\n    else miss\n        Server->>Server: compute\n    end\n    opt verbose\n        Server-->>Client: log\n    end\n    par fan out\n        Server->>Cache: a\n    and\n        Server->>Client: b\n    end\n    critical connect\n        Client->>Server: open\n    option timeout\n        Client->>Client: retry\n    end\n    break failed\n        Server-->>Client: error\n    end\n    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)\n        loop inner\n            Client->>Server: nested\n        end\n    end\n"
---

